@group B
@modset rps alex
@commands Boot with `rps alex` (Alex's Mobs 1.21.1 for 1.19.2 and Citadel beside the Raspberry Pie jar) (RPS-06)
@pass `Done (` reached; the Fleet-Footed mixin applies (no skip warning from Raspberry Pie); no mixin error
@fails `FleetFootedMixin` and the member check in `RpMixinPlugin` (P6); Alex's Mobs version differs from the tested 1.21.1 (raspberry_pie.md 12.2)
