## CQ-RPS-14 | drop after diversity set keeps the lower slots; respec, drop and death remove aged-out foods (#24, #26)
@group client
@commands Client with `rps only`, new survival world, operator. `/solrp diversity set @s 30`; fill slots 1 to 3 (effect screen, P); drop slot 3, confirm; `/solrp diversity get @s`. Then `/solrp reset @s`, eat 12 different vanilla foods, open the Diet Log Overview; change slot 1's effect, confirm; open the Diet Log again; `/kill @s`, respawn, open the Diet Log (RPS-14)
@pass after the drop slots 1 and 2 stay active with their effects, slot 3 is empty and grayed; diversity reads 27.49 (just under 27.5), not 0; the confirm panel listed only slot 3 and its effect as lost; after the change the 5 oldest foods are gone from the Last meals grid and the Diet Log history, diversity fell by what they gave; after death the grid and history are empty and diversity is 0; eating one of the aged-out foods again counts it in full
@fails `logic/SlotActions.planDrop` and `lowered` (Adjustment entry), `FoodWindow.ageOut`, `ServerEvents.respawn`; `client/DietLogPages.shownMeals`
@draft client steps: effect screen clicks and the Diet Log pages through the capture driver
