@pass the generated config has `extraWidth = 48` and lists `HARDEST` after `EASIEST` in the uneatenSort comment and allowed values; Hardest lists the uneaten foods from the highest base diversity down (ties: more hunger first), Easiest the reverse order of base diversity; the Diet Log opens at the same about 25% extra width as before
@fails `RpConfig.UneatenSort`, `client/FoodDictionarySort.uneaten`; `RpConfig` `extraWidth`
